# Every module's, not just the root's - a bare "target/" matches only at the context root,
# so core/target, cli/target and web/target were being sent to the daemon on every build.
**/target/

.git/
.gitignore
.github/

# Never bake credentials or pairing state into an image. These patterns have to be "**/"
# rather than bare names: a bare name matches only at the context root, and every one of
# these files now lives in ./data, which the next rule keeps out wholesale. Both are here
# on purpose, so moving the data directory cannot quietly re-open the hole.
data/
**/span-home.config.json
**/span-home.credentials.json
**/*.state.json
**/span-home.accessories.json
**/span-home.layout.json

deploy/
docs/
grafana/
prometheus.yml
*.md
!README.md

.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.DS_Store
*.log
